WEBVTT

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.630
It pleases me to see you now at your very end.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.000
Father Steyl.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.710
There's something I need to ask you.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.790
I guess now's not really the time, is it?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.080
Yuji...

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.290
Fireball!

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:45.080
Spell Transfer - Barrier!

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:51.710
Spell Transfer - Dispel!

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.040
Many thanks.

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:57.130
Seems you've had some trouble.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.830
Is he one of them?

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.040
You must be the emissary.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.000
That's Walter.

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:40.960
Maa ikkatte ukenagashite

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:44.170
Nochi no jinsei wa henka shinakute

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:46.330
Mou ikka wa joushuu no te de

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:49.670
Boku no nouryoku wa imada sakanai

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:54.540
Katou tomosezu makeru koto mo itowanai nara

00:01:54.710 --> 00:02:00.290
Mukishitsu na shinjou wa naze toki o utsu

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:06.460
Bokura dare mo ga himetaru chikara o motta monster

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:12.170
Da toshite mezame saseru koto naku ikitekuno

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.460
Oshikonde futa shite

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:18.210
Mou shinsen na kokoro janai

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:23.000
Sore demo kaoiro hitotsu kaezu ni ikiru monster

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:29.540
Dare mo ga mujikaku no sokojikara o uchi ni shinobaseru

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:33.250
Tsugi wa kimi no ban da

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:39.080
Tachimukaeyo monster

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.460
You must be the emissary.

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.210
That's Walter.

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:58.170
I've long awaited your arrival.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.420
My thanks for bringing him here, Steyl.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:17.080
Rise, awakened ones! Let them witness your power!

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.960
A-are we throwin' down?

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:29.540
Spell Transfer...

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:31.420
Fireball!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:46.960
Walter!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.210
Sure are lots of them.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.290
I-is this...?

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:23.210
That which grants me great power.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.250
Master Walter!

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.170
What is all of this?!

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:55.830
Witness for yourself, old friend!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.540
Come on! What now?!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.920
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:27.540
Look out!

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:36.040
You okay?

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.250
Yeah. Thanks for that, Proud Wolf.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.500
He must have infused himself with Dragon's Grace.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.790
What madness...

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:06.000
I feel its power flooding through me!

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:10.920
Spell Transfer - Anti-Magic Barrier! Anti-Physical Barrier!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.420
Wh-what is this?

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.040
Stay here with that little guy.

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:22.380
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:30.580
He's fast.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:39.580
Witness now the power of the mighty dragon!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:40.920
Proud Wolf...

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.960
I'm on it!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:43.750
Hiyah!

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.830
If he's just going to dodge individual attacks...

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.420
Then... Spell Transfer!

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.250
Fireball - Barrage!

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.330
He might be fast, but...

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.380
Spell Transfer - Fireball - Barrage!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:29.330
Your pathetic magic can't even scratch me!

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:30.420
Seriously?

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.670
He seems quite unfazed!

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.750
Fast and tough, huh?

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.500
Slime, maybe now's the time.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.290
Huh? Oh, 'kay!

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:51.750
Spell Transfer - Anti-Magic Barrier!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.130
This is all riding on you guys!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.880
Magic Boost! Physical Boost!

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:15.000
Oooh! Wow!

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:17.750
Time to show 'em what I'm made of!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:21.750
Impossible!

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.580
Let's get 'em!

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.960
Too slow. You're like a still frame.

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:31.920
What?!

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:33.790
Jump!

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:35.630
We're on him!

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.040
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.080
Yippee!

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.540
You see that?

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:59.080
Geigel's Monster Armor is no joke.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.920
No way!

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:26.750
He's good as new!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.330
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:35.830
You're wasting your time!

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:50.290
He's not just healing himself, he's powering up!

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.170
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.330
I'm telling you it's no use!

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.210
He's healing too fast.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.630
The curse of the Dragon's Grace is too powerful...

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:20.330
Wait... If it's a curse, then...

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:21.540
Proud Wolf.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:22.420
On it!

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:33.630
Fireball!

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.250
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.290
All right!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.880
I cannot be stopped!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.380
Spell Transfer - Dispel Curse - Extreme!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:51.920
How?!

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.790
Looks like it worked.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.250
How dare you...

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:02.630
Anti-Physical Barrier!

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:20.380
He's breaking through!

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:22.460
Yuji, we're ready!

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:23.290
Here goes.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:30.170
Spell Transfer - Magical Net

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.540
Spell Transfer - Magical Net - times 10!

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.790
I'm here to help!

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:46.250
Yeah!

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.790
Wrap him up real good!

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:51.880
Great work, everyone.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:53.500
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:09.750
We got him!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.460
The time has come...

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:27.420
Whether I eliminate the emissary
or he, I, it matters not now.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.880
Oh, great divine!

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:35.630
My life and those of all my followers
are yours for the taking.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:40.130
I ask only that you make
your revelation true, here and now!

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:45.960
This cannot be...

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:47.920
We won!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:49.670
Hooray! We did it!

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:51.290
That was almost too easy.

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:53.880
Something's not right.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.170
Why do you say that?

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:58.460
His dying remarks...

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.790
"Make your revelation true..."

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:04.420
Could that revelation have meant...

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:17.830
It's absorbing all magical energy!

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:30.790
"Cleanse this tainted world!"

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:37.420
What is all this?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.290
It's so sparkly!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.920
I don't like the look o' this!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:43.580
What is that?

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:08.210
Behold,

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.080
I am the Sage.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.580
Behold, I am the Sage.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.080
Is that Walter?

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:26.630
No, there was more to the revelation than I told you.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:31.540
"By the death of you who offers guidance,
shall the sage arise."

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:38.750
I believed that to mean that my death
would make you the sage who would save our world.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:41.880
But I couldn't have been more wrong...

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:46.170
It was Walter's death it spoke of.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.920
<b>Yuji</b>

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.920
<b>Class: Tamer, Sage</b>

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.920
<b>Skills: Taming, Sense Share, Holy Magic, Earth Magic,</b>

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.920
<b>Lighting Magic, Wind Magic, Support Magic, Buff Magic</b>

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:51.210
What is a sage, then?

00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:57.000
Our legends speak of the sage as such...

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:01.880
Long, long ago, an emissary of the divine rose
to face a mighty dragon.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.920
But, overwhelmed by its power,
the emissary met an untimely death.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:07.960
And you think he's that emissary?

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:15.500
It seems Walter worked to resurrect him,
sacrificing his own life and those of his followers

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:19.210
in order to perform something akin
to a Spirit Summoning Ceremony.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:21.960
A Spirit Summoning Ceremony...

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:24.880
That's meant to summon the divine, right?

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:29.420
Does that make this guy a god?

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:32.880
That thing is not the god we worship!

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:35.790
He is nothing of the sort!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.920
Hellfire of Demise!

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.830
That magic...

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.130
It was just like Yuji's!

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:04.920
This cannot be!

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:15.460
Never expected to be hit with that myself...

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:21.210
Slimes, you ready?

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.330
Yup!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.250
Always!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.830
Ready and prepared!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:26.710
Bring it on!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:34.130
Stamina Buff! Mobility Boost!
Defense Boost! Jump Boost!

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:37.580
That should make this easier.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:41.540
Alright, here goes, then!

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.380
Spell Transfer - Anti-Physical Barrier!

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:52.920
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.790
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:06.000
Everyone spread out!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.670
Got it!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:11.670
Spell Transfer - Anti-Physical Barrier - times 10!

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:20.580
Spell Transfer - Fireball - Barrage!

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:25.630
Best look this way!

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.000
No, over here!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.130
Hellfire of...

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.580
Monster Stealth!

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:32.210
...Decimation.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.330
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:47.170
Agh! So close!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.750
We could take him down with just a bit more, but...

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.580
...that took a lot of MP.

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:59.630
How can he keep shooting off
Hellfire of Demise and Hellfire of Decimation?

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:05.330
He might just have infinite MP.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.380
Everyone gather overhead!

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:10.130
On it!

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:15.500
Here goes!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.830
Okay?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:18.210
Ready... go!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:22.380
Prepare yourselves!

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:23.460
Here we go!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.380
Spell Transfer - Ranged Frost - Ultimate - times 10!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.880
Anti-Magic Barrier.

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.460
We're going for another!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.040
You got it!

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.670
Here goes!

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:00.670
Spell Transfer - Fireball - times 10!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:11.290
There we go.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.380
Hellfire of Decimation - times 10.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:25.040
Hellfire of Decimation - times 10!

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:34.040
This is unbelievable!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.790
We did it!

00:19:58.790 --> 00:19:59.960
That was awesome!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.500
<b>Status</b>

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.500
<b>Yuji</b>

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.500
<b>Super Combat Arts, Magic Maker</b>

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.500
<b>Type: None</b>

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.830
<b>Status Effect: Excessive Magic Use</b>

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:04.500
<b>Class: Tamer, Sage</b>

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:04.500
<b>Skills: Taming, Sense Share, Holy Magic, Dark Magic, Fire Magic, Water Magic, Ice Magic,</b>

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:04.500
<b>Earth Magic, Lightning Magic, Wind Magic, Support Magic, Buff Magic, Spell Transfer,</b>

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:04.500
That was too close...

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.170
What?! He doesn't even look hurt!

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:20.380
You gotta be kidding!

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:28.540
Oh great world,

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:32.380
I bring you now your salvation!

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:03.580
The Dragon's Grace...?

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:26.170
You call this salvation?!

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:34.540
This isn't looking good.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:41.040
<b>EPISODE 11</b>

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:41.040
<b>THE REVELATION CAME TRUE</b>

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:43.750
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:46.790
Tansaku mo choutatsu mo ote no mono

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:48.170
"Tomodachi takusan tsukretekita yo!"

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:51.880
Machi made ato ippo no toko de encount

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:53.290
"Haa kufuku de! Chikara ga nee!"

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:54.750
"Kibichii mamono ga jiirojiro!"

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.210
"Maji panee! Maji panee!"

00:21:56.210 --> 00:22:01.330
"Yabami yaseimi nirami ga sugomi...!"

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.420
"Fumu, koko wa okunote shika nai desuzo...!"

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:00.040
"Sonnano attakke?"

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:02.330
"Niigerun da yo!"

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:05.540
Shikashi mawarikomarete shimatta

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:10.960
Zenmetsu suru to wa nani goto ka!

00:22:12.710 --> 00:22:18.830
Yuushatachi yo tachiagare!

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:20.250
"Karyoku infure zoukyouyaku"

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:21.420
"Kameba kamu hodo chou kaifuku"

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:24.330
Tsuyomi ga tsuyomi ga deruzo

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:27.330
Happadayo!

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:27.330
"Itadaitokimashou!"

00:22:27.330 --> 00:22:29.670
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:36.170
Youyaku aritsuketa gohan ga oishii ne!

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:38.920
Doukutsu demo mayoi no mori demo

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:41.920
Aa manpuku manzoku shizen no baikingu

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:46.960
Onaka ga suite wa ikusa ga dekinai ne!

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:52.130
Ikuzo gattai kougekida! Tobikiri magical tsuyoi yatsu

00:22:52.210 --> 00:22:55.210
Chi o saki hi wo fuke!

00:22:55.210 --> 00:22:56.630
"Hyakuninriki no kyuukyoku mahou da!"

00:22:56.630 --> 00:22:58.000
"Maryoku to cheat no housekibako da!"

00:22:58.000 --> 00:22:59.420
"Shuuen no gouka de ichimoudajin da!"

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:02.210
"Toiu yume o mitan da ne?"

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:04.830
CHEST!

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:07.330
Yuji! Yuji! Saikyou! Kenja! Yuji! Yuji! Uoo tame me!

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:09.670
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.540
Time for an isekai preview from us slimes!

00:23:13.670 --> 00:23:15.500
Really though, what's a "preview" anyway?

00:23:15.500 --> 00:23:16.580
Can we eat it?

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:17.420
Beats me!

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:19.170
We've gone on so many adventures!

00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:20.540
What sorts?

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:21.920
Don't really remember!

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:22.670
Seriously?

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:24.290
But we most certainly had fun!

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.290
There were tough times too, maybe.

00:23:26.290 --> 00:23:27.500
Tough how?

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:28.880
Don't really remember!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:29.580
Seriously?!

00:23:29.580 --> 00:23:32.080
Best not to reminisce about the bad times!

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:33.920
Just forget and move on!

00:23:33.920 --> 00:23:36.830
Let's all say it together! Ready?

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>MY ISEKAI LIFE</b>

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:39.460
"My Isekai Life!"
